1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Suzhou once had over 200 private gardens.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,000
Nine are now UNESCO World Heritage.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,300
The oldest date back nearly 1,000 years.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,700
Each shrinks a whole landscape into a courtyard.

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,100
Rocks become mountains; ponds become seas.

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,500
You never see it all at once — that's the design.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,700
Double-tap if you'd wander one of these.

8
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,900
★ Expert Tip: Visit the Humble Administrator's Garden at opening, before the tour crowds.

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,500
